-12-ene substituted by a hydroxy group at position 3, an oxo group at position 11 and a carboxy group at position 30. It has a role as an immunomodulator and a plant metabolite. It is a pentacyclic triterpenoid, a cyclic terpene ketone and a hydroxy monocarboxylic acid. It is a conjugate acid of a glycyrrhetinate. It derives from a hydride of an oleanane.','InChI=1S/C30H46O4/c1-25(2)21-8-11-30(7)23(28(21,5)10-9-22(25)32)20(31)16-18-19-17-27(4,24(33)34)13-12-26(19,3)14-15-29(18,30)6/h16,19,21-23,32H,8-15,17H2,1-7H3,(H,33,34)/t19-,21-,22-,23+,26+,27-,28-,29+,30+/m0/s1','MPDGHEJMBKOTSU-YKLVYJNSSA-N','C[C@]12CC[C@](C[C@H]1C3=CC(=O)[C@@H]4[C@]5(CC[C@@H](C([C@@H]5CC[C@]4([C@@]3(CC2)C)C)(C)C)O)C)(C)C(=O)O','C30H46O4',470.7,6.4,2,4,1,34),(101254244,'3-O-(2\'E,4\'Z-decadienoyl)-20-deoxyingenol','None','None','None','InChI=1S/C30H42O5/c1-7-8-9-10-11-12-13-14-23(31)35-27-19(3)17-29-20(4)16-22-24(28(22,5)6)21(26(29)33)15-18(2)25(32)30(27,29)34/h11-15,17,20-22,24-25,27,32,34H,7-10,16H2,1-6H3/b12-11-,14-13+/t20-,21+,22-,24+,25-,27+,29+,30+/m1/s1','JZIBSDBSLIKLEM-SPXYNGGESA-N','CCCCC/C=CC=CC(=O)O[C@H]1C(=C[C@@]23[C@@]1([C@@H](C(=C[C@H](C2=O)[C@H]4[C@H](C4(C)C)C[C@H]3C)C)O)O)C','C30H42O5',482.6,5,2,5,8,35),(101306702,'Rhodojaponin II','Rhodojaponin II has been reported in Rhododendron japonoheptamerum, Rhododendron catawbiense, and other organisms with data available.','Rhodojaponin II has been reported in Rhododendron japonoheptamerum, Rhododendron catawbiense, and other organisms with data available.','Rhodojaponin II has been reported in Rhododendron japonoheptamerum, Rhododendron catawbiense, and other organisms with data available.','InChI=1S/C22H34O7/c1-10(23)28-13-8-21-9-19(4,25)11(16(21)24)6-7-12(21)20(5,26)15-14-17(29-14)18(2,3)22(13,15)27/h11-17,24-27H,6-9H2,1-5H3/t11-,12+,13-,14+,15+,16-,17+,19-,20-,21+,22-/m1/s1','FJISLLRXVSQIES-JOIIKWRGSA-N','CC(=O)O[C@@H]1C[C@@]23C[C@@]([C@@H]([C@H]2O)CC[C@H]3[C@@]([C@H]4[C@]1(C([C@@H]5[C@H]4O5)(C)C)O)(C)O)(C)O','C22H34O7',410.5,0.3,4